 ('traits','Eight current racial profiles',table(['Race','Inspected benefits','Editorial use'],[['Human','Periodic damage; experience and gold bonuses.','General progression when available.'],['Orc','Periodic damage surge and extra maximum health.','Combine damage with a larger health buffer.'],['Dwarf','Periodic health-scaled shield, damage and pickup range.','A defensive/collection alternative.'],['Night Elf','Near-death immunity, movement and damage reduction.','Space to recover when positioning fails.'],['Undead','Near-death immunity, kill healing and damage reduction.','Dense waves offer more healing events than an isolated boss.'],['Tauren','Periodic nearby stun and 15% extra maximum health.','An editorial survival pick if this class can use it.'],['Gnome','Periodic nearby roots, shorter cooldowns and luck.','Repeated casting and space to move.'],['Troll','Periodic faster cooldown recovery, regeneration and critical chance.','Casting with steady recovery.']])+p('This paraphrases the v0.130.0 race text; the actual picker prints exact durations and values. These are automatic described effects, not proof of encounter immunity or controlled damage advantage.')),
