 ('download','Choose a source before choosing a workaround',steps(['Export your existing save from the client where it still exists.','For browser play, open '+ext('https://wow.aethus.pl/','Aethus · original browser game')+' directly and let its data download finish.','For Windows, follow '+ext('https://wow.aethus.pl/download/AzerothSurvivorsWindowsNew.rar','Aethus · Windows archive')+' from the original host. Extract the complete archive, keeping the executable and Data folder together.','Check the displayed game version after opening it. Do not assume the archive matches the current browser patch.','For other packages or a slow source, check the creator-linked community. A player-shared mirror or lookalike domain is not independently authenticated by its filename.'])+p('We did not download and execute the Windows package or certify a checksum. A community GitHub reconstruction is a different project; it is not a transparent substitute for the original save and rules.')),
